  "body": "Here is a fantastic opportunity for your family to secure a fully renovated Home & Income in the sought-after Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nMove-in ready and beautifully presented, this property offers four bedrooms in the main home plus a separate one-bedroom income — an ideal setup for families, extended family or those looking for additional income.\r\n\r\nMain Home:\r\nThe main home features four bedrooms, one bathroom, a separate toilet and a dedicated laundry.\r\nFully renovated throughout with fresh paint and new carpet, the home feels bright, fresh and welcoming.\r\nThe spacious deck provides plenty of room for outdoor dining, entertaining and family time.\r\n\r\nSeparate Income:\r\nThe separate income offers one bedroom, one bathroom and a kitchenette, providing excellent privacy and flexibility.\r\nIt also has its own separate electricity meter, making it a practical option for rental income or extended family.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Fully renovated Home & Income\r\n• 4-bedroom main home + 1-bedroom income\r\n• Double glazing throughout both areas\r\n• Separate electricity meter for the income\r\n• Fresh interior and exterior paint\r\n• New carpet\r\n• Tile roof\r\n• Spacious sunny deck\r\n• Plenty of off-street parking\r\n• Move-in ready\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nZoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain Primary School.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a quiet and friendly neighbourhood, with PAK’nSAVE, Highland Park Shopping Centre, childcare centres and public transport all close by.\r\n\r\nHalf Moon Bay Marina and ferry services are also within easy reach, making commuting to the city convenient.\r\n\r\nFully renovated. Home & Income. Top school zones. Ready to move in.",
